# Quantitative Analysis and Forecasting in Finance: Leveraging Wavelet Packet Transform for Enhanced Market Insights

**Authors:** Mrs. M. Libina, Mrs. C. Kavitha, Mr. A. Kabilan

## Abstract
Finance forecasting is always known for its ever-changing and complex nature in geopolitical markets, requiring advanced analytical tools to provide valuable deep insights for financial advisors, investors, and vital decision-makers. In this study, we delve into the realm of both quantitative analysis and forecasting in finance-related markets, utilizing sophisticated techniques to enhance our understanding of the markets. Our study focuses on the innovative utilization of the Optimized Wavelet Packet Transform (WPT), an advanced tool for processing signals, to uncover complex patterns within financial time series data through quantitative analysis using Plotly’s interactive line charts. It bridges the gap between quantitative analysis and forecasting. It also reaches an accuracy rate of 99.5%, which is considered the best among the other prediction models. These insights help stakeholders and advisors navigate the ever-evolving landscape of financial markets and make decisions wisely.

